# Inventory module (contracts/openapi/inventory.yaml). Get tokens with auth.http first, then run tenant.http
# (locationId) and catalog.http (oilVariantId, canId) so the variables below are set.

### Opening balance: 10 cans of oil at 13,800.00 (INV-17)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock/opening-balances
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{"locationId": "{{locationId}}",
 "lines": [{"variantId": "{{oilVariantId}}", "packagingUnitId": "{{canId}}", "qty": "10", "unitCost": "13800.00"}]}

### A dented can is written off (INV-11)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock/adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{"locationId": "{{locationId}}", "reason": "DAMAGED",
 "lines": [{"variantId": "{{oilVariantId}}", "packagingUnitId": "{{canId}}", "qty": "1"}]}

### Reorder below 2 cans, order 5 (INV-13)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/variants/{{oilVariantId}}/reorder-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"locationId": "{{locationId}}", "reorderLevel": "39130.56", "reorderQty": "97826.4"}

### Balances of the oil
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock/balances?variantId={{oilVariantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### The ledger, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock/movements?variantId={{oilVariantId}}&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### What the stock is worth now, by product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock/valuation?groupBy=product
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### What to reorder
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock/reorder-list
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Open a stock count
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock/counts
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{"locationId": "{{locationId}}"}

> {% client.global.set("countId", response.body.id); %}

### Rebuild the balances from the ledger (INV-16)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/stock/rebuild-balances
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
